// Claude Desktop — theme selection (claude-desktop-extra).
//
// "catppuccin-mocha" is one of the fork's 7 BUILT-IN themes, so naming it here
// is enough — no "themes" palette block is needed. The other Catppuccin
// flavours are catppuccin-macchiato, catppuccin-frappe and catppuccin-latte.
//
// The theme supplies a dual light/dark palette; which half is used follows the
// app's OWN toggle in Settings -> Appearance. Leave that on Dark to get Mocha.
//
// NOTE: this file becomes a read-only store symlink, exactly like fcitx5's
// profile (see ../../home/dotfiles.nix). The app's in-app theme picker
// (Ctrl+Shift+T / Settings -> Extra -> Themes) writes back to this path, so it
// will NOT be able to persist a change — edit this file in the repo and rebuild
// instead. Hand edits are read at startup, so restart the app afterwards.
{
  "activeTheme": "catppuccin-mocha"
}
